`,n.jsxs(t.p,{children:["This is why modern neural retrievers rely on classical search like BM25 during training. We use BM25 to find documents that match all the right keywords but contain the wrong answer, and feed those exact mistakes to the neural network as hard negatives. ",n.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Classical search doesn't die; it becomes the teacher that exposes the neural network's blind spots."})]}),`
